  SNYK-JS-BRACEEXPANSION-18313044:
    - react-query@3.39.3 > broadcast-channel@3.7.0 > rimraf@3.0.2 > glob@7.2.3 > minimatch@3.1.2 > brace-expansion@2.0.2:
        reason: >-
            broadcast-channel is only reachable via react-query's
            broadcastQueryClient-experimental entry point, which we don't import; its
            rimraf/glob usage is Node-only and stubbed out in browser bundles via the
            package browser field. Glob patterns are internal temp paths, never user
            input.
